DL_WHATS_NEW_TITLE=What's new in Creative Cloud libraries:
DL_WHATS_NEW_GENERAL=General bug fixes and performance updates.
DL_WHATS_NEW_FONTS=Introducing Libraries in Adobe Fonts – You can now create and publicly share collection of font elements on fonts.adobe.com and use them across apps like Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign.
DL_WHATS_NEW_BACKGROUND_SYNC=Performance improvements - Libraries will no longer continuously sync in the background - only while there is an active session in an application that is using Libraries.
DL_WHATS_NEW_TRANSPARENCY=Toggle on the transparency grid from the menu to improve thumbnail readability.
DL_WHATS_NEW_COLLAPSE_GROUPS=Quickly collapse groups by holding the option/alt key while toggling a group closed.
DL_WHATS_NEW_XD_IMPROVEMENTS=Improved tooltips in XD, and enhancements for working with document assets.
DL_WHATS_NEW_ONE_UP=Introducing the new expanded asset view. Dive into a full panel experience of any asset including all the details and metadata.
DL_WHATS_NEW_RESPONSIVE_LAYOUT=Enjoy the new responsive behavior when resizing the panel.
DL_WHATS_NEW_CCD_DRAG_OUT=Drag graphics, images, templates, videos, and audio files out of the Creative Cloud Desktop application to easily export them into other applications or your file system.
DL_WHATS_NEW_QUOTA=Libraries will now count against your Creative Cloud Storage. You can manage your storage in the Your Work section of the Creative Cloud desktop application or assets.adobe.com on the web.
DL_WHATS_NEW_PUBLISH=For published libraries linked to documents you now have the option to republish to a different library in the Library Manager in XD.
DL_WHATS_NEW_NESTED_GROUPS=Introducing groups within groups. Organize your elements into subgroups as many levels deep as you need for your creative projects. Collaborators will see your groups when selecting group by "Custom group".
DL_WHATS_NEW_QUOTA_2=Libraries will now count against your Creative Cloud Storage. You can manage your storage in the Files section of the Creative Cloud desktop application or assets.adobe.com on the web.
DL_WHATS_NEW_PATH_VIEW=Libraries now offers subgroups in a condensed path view. Quickly create subgroups using the "/" character in a group name, and toggle back and forth between tree view and path view to see the expanded or condensed group structure.
DL_WHATS_NEW_RELINK=You can now repair and relink missing library elements in your document assets in XD. Right click on an asset to manage the broken link.
DL_WHATS_NEW_COLORS=Libraries now support Color Themes with up to 20 swatches. Colors Themes can be created at color.adobe.com.
DL_WHATS_NEW_LIBRARY_DELETE=Libraries that are deleted can now be recovered after up to 30 days in assets.adobe.com.
DL_WHATS_NEW_GRADIENTS_PATTERNS=Add your favorite gradient and pattern elements from Adobe Illustrator into Libraries. Enjoy creating and using gradients and patterns from Ai within the app and across other Creative Cloud products.
DL_WHATS_NEW_PROJECTS=The destination for 'Libraries in business storage' will now refer to and surface as 'Projects'.

